    {
      "id": "claim_aff78449f8024caf822538443db909e2",
      "statement": "The ?flow=signup marker raises the in-memory justSignedUp signal, which the Shell copies into a local signal and immediately resets so the welcome banner appears once per fresh signup (email verification or OAuth) and is never persisted.",
