      "statement": "provideRhAuth() registers rhAuthInterceptor, which applies the session to every HttpClient request bound for apiBaseUrl — the bearer token, challenge suppression that keeps the browser's Basic Auth popup away on a 401, and cookie credentials. Requests to any other host pass through untouched.",
